}

Rules:
  - "help_request" is REQUIRED when status = "needs_help", and omitted otherwise.
  - "lessons_learned" is ALWAYS present with at least one entry, even on needs_help.
  - No prose outside the JSON object. No markdown fences are needed; if you use
    them, use ```json.
"""

